Package: RLdrop
Title: Direct Dropbox API Access via httr
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Roger", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "your@email.com")
Description: Provides functions to upload and download files and folders
    directly via the Dropbox API v2, bypassing the Dropbox desktop client
    sync queue. Useful for on-demand access to specific files without
    waiting for the client to synchronise.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports:
    httr,
    jsonlite
